    - Name: tooltip
      Entry: 1
      Data: Flat dark skybox material swapped in while submerged. Skyboxes never
        receive fog, so any sightline that never hits geometry (looking out past
        the terrain/water mesh edges) would otherwise punch straight through to the
        raw starfield, breaking the underwater illusion at range.
